{{define "content"}}
<h1>Mappings / 模型别名映射</h1>

<p class="muted">
  本地客户端请求里的 <code>model</code> 不会直接发给上游，会先在这里按 <code>站点 + 协议 + 别名</code> 查映射。没有匹配映射的站点会被路由跳过。
</p>

{{if .EditMapping}}
<p>当前正在编辑映射 ID <strong>{{.EditMapping.ID}}</strong> · <a href="/admin/mappings">取消编辑</a></p>
{{end}}

<form class="card" method="post" action="{{if .EditMapping}}/admin/mappings/update{{else}}/admin/mappings{{end}}">
  <input type="hidden" name="write_token" value="{{.WriteToken}}">
  {{if .EditMapping}}<input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{.EditMapping.ID}}">{{end}}

  <div class="grid-2">
    <label class="field">
      <span class="field-label">关联站点 <span class="en">Station</span></span>
      <span class="field-hint">此映射所属的上游站点；同一别名要在多个站点生效就分别建多条映射。</span>
      <select name="station_id" required>
        <option value="">— 请选择站点 —</option>
        {{range .Stations}}
        <option value="{{.ID}}" {{if and $.EditMapping (eq .ID $.EditMapping.StationID)}}selected{{end}}>{{.Name}} (ID {{.ID}})</option>
        {{end}}
      </select>
    </label>

    <label class="field">
      <span class="field-label">协议 <span class="en">Protocol</span></span>
      <span class="field-hint"><code>openai</code> 走 <code>/openai/v1/*</code>，<code>anthropic</code> 走 <code>/anthropic/v1/messages</code>。</span>
      <select name="protocol" required>
        <option value="openai" {{if and .EditMapping (eq (printf "%s" .EditMapping.Protocol) "openai")}}selected{{end}}>openai</option>
        <option value="anthropic" {{if and .EditMapping (eq (printf "%s" .EditMapping.Protocol) "anthropic")}}selected{{end}}>anthropic</option>
      </select>
    </label>

    <label class="field">
      <span class="field-label">本地别名 <span class="en">Alias</span></span>
      <span class="field-hint">客户端请求 body 里 <code>model</code> 字段使用的名字，例如 <code>gpt-5</code> 或 <code>claude-sonnet</code>。</span>
      <input name="alias" placeholder="gpt-5" value="{{if .EditMapping}}{{.EditMapping.Alias}}{{end}}" required>
    </label>

    <label class="field">
      <span class="field-label">上游真实模型 <span class="en">Upstream model</span></span>
      <span class="field-hint">实际发给中转站的模型名，例如 <code>gpt-5.1</code> 或 <code>claude-sonnet-4-5</code>。</span>
      <input name="upstream_model" placeholder="gpt-5.1" value="{{if .EditMapping}}{{.EditMapping.UpstreamModel}}{{end}}" required>
    </label>
  </div>

  <div class="field" style="margin-top: 6px;">
    <span class="field-label">启用 <span class="en">Enabled</span></span>
    <span class="field-hint">禁用后此别名不会再被这个站点承接，路由会跳到下一候选。</span>
    <label class="field-check">
      <input type="checkbox" name="enabled" {{if .EditMapping}}{{if .EditMapping.Enabled}}checked{{end}}{{else}}checked{{end}}>
      <span>启用此映射</span>
    </label>
  </div>

  <div class="actions">
    <button type="submit">{{if .EditMapping}}Update Mapping{{else}}Save Mapping{{end}}</button>
    {{if .EditMapping}}<a class="btn subtle" href="/admin/mappings">取消</a>{{end}}
  </div>
</form>

<h2>Existing Mappings / 已配置映射</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>站点</th>
      <th>Station ID</th>
      <th>协议</th>
      <th>本地别名</th>
      <th>上游模型</th>
      <th>启用</th>
      <th>操作</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {{range .Mappings}}
    <tr>
      <td>{{with index $.StationNameByID .StationID}}{{.}}{{else}}<span class="muted">Unknown station</span>{{end}}</td>
      <td class="muted">{{.StationID}}</td>
      <td>{{.Protocol}}</td>
      <td>{{.Alias}}</td>
      <td>{{.UpstreamModel}}</td>
      <td>{{if .Enabled}}<span class="pill ok">on</span>{{else}}<span class="pill">off</span>{{end}}</td>
      <td><a href="/admin/mappings/edit?id={{.ID}}">编辑</a></td>
    </tr>
    {{else}}
    <tr>
      <td colspan="7" class="muted">No mappings configured yet. / 还没有映射。</td>
    </tr>
    {{end}}
  </tbody>
</table>
{{end}}
